%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e7f30f51b8ce4acb88ac528f35c4f85d, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarratorVoiceBank
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  captionFont: {fileID: 12800000, guid: 2c4d93be511cf4720910a1b57c26f54f, type: 3}
  lines:
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_intro
    text: The sun is up over Kylo's house, and a brand new school day is starting.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_bangon_story
    text: Good morning! Kylo is still sleeping. It is time to wake up and start his day!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_bangon_ask
    text: Let's help Kylo out of bed! Say {word} to wake him up!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_bangon_done
    text: Great job! Kylo is finally awake.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_tayo_story
    text: Kylo is awake, but he is still sitting on his bed. He needs to stand up first.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_tayo_ask
    text: "Help Kylo onto his feet \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_tayo_done
    text: Well done! Kylo is standing beside his bed now.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_lakad_story
    text: Kylo is standing, and the bedroom door is waiting across the room.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_lakad_ask
    text: Send him on his way with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_lakad_done
    text: Excellent! Kylo is walking towards the door.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s1_outro
    text: Nice work! Kylo is out of bed. Now let's help him get to the bathroom.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_intro
    text: Kylo is out of his room, and the hallway stretches away in front of him.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_lakad_story
    text: The hallway is long and quiet, and the bathroom is at the far end.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_lakad_ask
    text: Start him moving with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_lakad_done
    text: Good! Kylo is walking down the hallway.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kaliwa_story
    text: Kylo has stopped. There are doors on both sides, and he is not sure which way.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kaliwa_ask
    text: "Point him to the left \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kaliwa_done
    text: That's it! Kylo is looking to his left.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kanan_story
    text: Nothing on the left but Nanay's room. The other side is worth a look.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kanan_ask
    text: Turn him the other way with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_kanan_done
    text: Good eye! The bathroom door is on his right.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_bukas_story
    text: Kylo has found the bathroom door, but it is shut tight.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_bukas_ask
    text: Let's get that door open! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_bukas_done
    text: Wonderful! The door swings open for Kylo.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_ilaw_story
    text: Inside the bathroom it is still dark, and Kylo cannot see a thing.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_ilaw_ask
    text: "Brighten the room for him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_ilaw_done
    text: Perfect! The bathroom is bright and warm now.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_tabo_story
    text: Kylo can see the water jar now, with a blue dipper resting on top.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_tabo_ask
    text: Help him lift it down! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_tabo_done
    text: Nice! Kylo is holding the tabo in his hands.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_sabon_story
    text: Water alone will not get Kylo clean. He needs something that makes bubbles.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_sabon_ask
    text: "Help him reach for it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_sabon_done
    text: Great! Kylo has the soap ready for his bath.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_sipilyo_story
    text: Kylo's teeth need cleaning too, before breakfast and before school.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_sipilyo_ask
    text: Hand him the right one by saying {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_sipilyo_done
    text: Well done! Kylo is brushing his teeth.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_tuwalya_story
    text: When Kylo finishes washing, he will be soaking wet from head to toe.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_tuwalya_ask
    text: "Get him something to dry with \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_tuwalya_done
    text: Excellent! Kylo has everything he needs now.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s2_outro
    text: Everything is ready. Now Kylo can take his bath.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_intro
    text: The bathroom is ready, and so is Kylo.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_kaliwa_story
    text: Kylo is by the door. The water jar is on the other side of the room.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_kaliwa_ask
    text: Send him that way with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_kaliwa_done
    text: Good! Kylo has moved over to the water jar.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_maligo_story
    text: The water is cool and the soap is ready. This is Kylo's favourite part.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_maligo_ask
    text: Let's get him washing! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_maligo_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo is clean from head to toe.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_suklay_story
    text: Kylo is clean, but his hair is sticking up in every direction.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_suklay_ask
    text: "Tidy it up for him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_suklay_done
    text: Very nice! Kylo's hair is neat and smooth.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s3_outro
    text: All clean! Now Kylo needs to get dressed for school.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_intro
    text: Kylo is back in his bedroom, dripping wet and wrapped in his towel.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_damit_story
    text: Kylo cannot go to school in his towel. His uniform is folded on the bed.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_damit_ask
    text: "Help him put them on \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_damit_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo is dressed in his school uniform.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_medyas_story
    text: Kylo's feet are still bare, and the bedroom floor is cold.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_medyas_ask
    text: Warm them up for him! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_medyas_done
    text: Nice! Kylo has his socks on.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_sapatos_story
    text: Socks alone will not do for the long walk to school.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_sapatos_ask
    text: Finish his feet off with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_sapatos_done
    text: Great job! Kylo is ready to walk anywhere.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_bag_story
    text: Kylo's books are packed and waiting on the chair by the door.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_bag_ask
    text: "Point him at it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_bag_done
    text: Good! Kylo has spotted his school bag.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_kunin_story
    text: The bag is right there, but it will not carry itself.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_kunin_ask
    text: Help him pick it up by saying {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_kunin_done
    text: Excellent! Kylo has his bag over his shoulder.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s4_outro
    text: Kylo is dressed and packed. But first, he needs his breakfast!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_intro
    text: Nanay has made breakfast, and the whole kitchen smells wonderful.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_upo_story
    text: Breakfast is on the table, and Kylo's chair is empty and waiting.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_upo_ask
    text: "Get him settled \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_upo_done
    text: Good! Kylo is sitting at the table.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kanin_story
    text: There is a warm white heap on Kylo's plate. Filipino families eat it daily.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kanin_ask
    text: "Name it for Kylo \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kanin_done
    text: That's right! Kylo's plate is full of rice.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_itlog_story
    text: Beside the rice is something round, with a sunny yellow middle.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_itlog_ask
    text: "Tell Kylo what it is \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_itlog_done
    text: Well done! The egg is Kylo's favourite part.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kain_story
    text: Everything is on the plate now, and Kylo's tummy is rumbling.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kain_ask
    text: Let him start his breakfast! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_kain_done
    text: Yummy! Kylo is enjoying every bite.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_inom_story
    text: All that rice has made Kylo thirsty. There is a glass beside his plate.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_inom_ask
    text: Help him finish it off with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_inom_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo's breakfast is all done.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l1_s5_outro
    text: Breakfast is finished. It is time for Kylo to head off to school!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_intro
    text: Here is Kylo's school! The gate is open and the yard is full of children.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_kumusta_story
    text: The guard at the gate smiles at Kylo every single morning.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_kumusta_ask
    text: "Greet him back \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_kumusta_done
    text: Lovely manners! The guard waves Kylo through.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_pasok_story
    text: The gate is open, and the school building is just across the yard.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_pasok_ask
    text: Take him inside with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_pasok_done
    text: Good! Kylo is through the gate.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_takbo_story
    text: The bell is about to ring, and walking will not be fast enough.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_takbo_ask
    text: "Hurry him along \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_takbo_done
    text: Excellent! Kylo made it before the bell.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s1_outro
    text: You made it in time! Now let's find Kylo's classroom.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_intro
    text: Kylo is outside his classroom, and Teacher Rachel is already inside.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_bukas_story
    text: The classroom door is closed, and the lesson is about to begin.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_bukas_ask
    text: "Let him in \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_bukas_done
    text: Good! The classroom door is open.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_kumusta_story
    text: Teacher Rachel looks up from her desk and smiles at Kylo.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_kumusta_ask
    text: "Greet Teacher Rachel back \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_kumusta_done
    text: Very polite! Teacher Rachel smiles back at him.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_upo_story
    text: Kylo's desk is near the window, and his classmates are already seated.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_upo_ask
    text: "Get him into his chair \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_upo_done
    text: Good! Kylo is in his seat, ready to learn.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_kuha_story
    text: The lesson is starting, and Kylo's desk is completely empty.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_kuha_ask
    text: "Reach into the bag for him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_kuha_done
    text: Nice! Kylo is reaching into his school bag.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_lapis_story
    text: There is one thing Kylo needs before he can write anything down.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_lapis_ask
    text: "Name it for him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_lapis_done
    text: Well done! Kylo has his pencil on the desk.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s2_outro
    text: Everyone is ready. It is time for the lesson to begin!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_intro
    text: Teacher Rachel is at the board, and today's lesson is about to start.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_aklat_story
    text: Teacher Rachel asks the class to take something out of their bags.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_aklat_ask
    text: "Help Kylo find it \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_aklat_done
    text: Good! Kylo's book is open on his desk.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_basa_story
    text: The page is open, and the whole class is following along out loud.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_basa_ask
    text: "Let Kylo join in \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_basa_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo is reading with the class.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sulat_story
    text: Teacher Rachel writes a new word on the board for everyone to copy.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sulat_ask
    text: Get his pencil moving with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sulat_done
    text: Excellent! Kylo is writing the word down.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_tanong_story
    text: Kylo does not understand one part, and his hand goes half way up.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_tanong_ask
    text: "Give him the courage \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_tanong_done
    text: Brave boy! Kylo has asked his question.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sagot_story
    text: Teacher Rachel turns to Kylo and waits for him to reply.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sagot_ask
    text: Help him speak up by saying {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_sagot_done
    text: Well done! Kylo gave the right answer.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s3_outro
    text: Excellent work! Kylo is learning so many new words.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_intro
    text: The recess bell has rung, and the classroom is emptying fast.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_labas_story
    text: Kylo's classmates are already streaming out into the sunshine.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_labas_ask
    text: "Let him out into the sun \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_labas_done
    text: Good! Kylo is out in the school yard.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_kain_story
    text: Nanay packed Kylo a snack, and it is still sitting in his bag.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_kain_ask
    text: "Let him start his snack \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_kain_done
    text: Yummy! Kylo has finished his snack.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_laro_story
    text: Kylo's classmates are chasing each other across the yard.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_laro_ask
    text: Send him over to join them! Say {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_laro_done
    text: Wonderful! Kylo is playing with his classmates.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tawa_story
    text: One of Kylo's friends makes the silliest face in the whole school.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tawa_ask
    text: "Let it out of him \u2014 say {word}!"
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tawa_done
    text: What a happy sound! Kylo is laughing.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tulong_story
    text: A smaller child has tripped and dropped everything on the ground.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tulong_ask
    text: Send Kylo over with {word}!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_tulong_done
    text: So kind! Kylo helped the little one up.
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s4_outro
    text: That was fun, but recess is over. Back to class!
    gloss: 
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - id: rachel_l2_s5_intro
    text: Recess is over. There is one more lesson before home time.
